{title: Chiefs of Edom}
{subtitle: Genesis 36:43; 1 Chronicles 1:54; Genesis 36:1–9; 36:40–43}
{key: Cm}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 2/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Cm] | [Cm] | [Cm] | [Cm] |
